=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_9c4f — No evening run; water bottle at dinner; Omar's solo TV (fork of p_e1a5)

Marco does not run in the evening. The parent (p_e1a5) predicted his running shoes and water bottle would be OUT_OF_HOUSE from 19:30 to 20:15 on weekdays, but the water bottle was sighted at dining_table_d1 at 20:00 — it is at the dinner table, not out the door. The running shoes have been seen at shoe_rack_e1 on both sighted days with no out-of-house sightings at any hour. I remove both OUT_OF_HOUSE evening blocks.

What changed from the parent: (1) running_shoes_marco stays at shoe_rack_e1 all day — no evening run. (2) water_bottle_marco is at dining_table_d1 during dinner (19–20:5 h) instead of OUT_OF_HOUSE. (3) The remote is on the living-room floor (floor_l_l1) during the later part of Omar's solo TV (21–22:5 h), consistent with the 22:00 floor sighting, rather than remaining on the TV stand.

What sets this apart: no object leaves the house in the evening on weekdays; the water bottle is a dinner-table object. Refuted if: running_shoes_marco is sighted OUT_OF_HOUSE at any hour on a weekday, or water_bottle_marco is sighted OUT_OF_HOUSE at 19:45 on a weekday.

